excerpt: 'Print Scripture Builder cutouts the way the app chunks them. Tiles stay unnumbered so the order is not on the paper.'
tags: ['doctrinal-mastery', 'teacher-tip']
author: 'Patrick'
---

Scripture Builder printouts are live. All 100 doctrinal mastery verses from the app, three levels.

Beginner and Intermediate are compact mixed cut-out tiles. Same chunks as the app. Unnumbered, so the sequence is not sitting on the paper.

Advanced is first-letter hints, matching Advanced in the app. Not cutouts, and not the full verse.

Open a verse, then use the browser Print dialog (Save as PDF, US Letter). Ready PDFs are there for 2 Nephi 2:25.

[https://seminarysidekick.com/teachers/printouts](/teachers/printouts)
